cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "Tropical cyclone rapid intensification from geostationary infrared imagery"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline, statistical baselines and controlled experiments for
  predicting 24-hour rapid intensification (>= 30 kt) of tropical cyclones
  from GridSat-B1 infrared imagery, including a test of Dvorak-derived label
  contamination in best-track intensity.
type: software
authors:
