repository-code: "https://github.com/Sharkeeeeeee/tropical-cyclone-ri"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - tropical cyclone
  - rapid intensification
  - satellite imagery
  - GridSat-B1
  - IBTrACS
  - Dvorak technique
  - machine learning
